                                of growth. The Enneagram is often used for personal and spiritual development, as well
                                as in various professional fields, including psychology, business, and leadership
                                training. It provides a nuanced understanding of individuals and their interpersonal
                                dynamics, offering insights into both strengths and challenges associated with each
                                personality type.
                            </p>
