                                                    </h2>
                                                    <h2 class="main_heading">In a Nutshell</h2>
                                                    <p class="description">
                                                        Enneagram Type 5, the Investigator, is a cerebral and insightful
                                                        individual characterized by a core desire for understanding and
                                                        a fear of being overwhelmed. Fives are the intellectual
                                                        explorers of the Enneagram, driven by a thirst for knowledge and
                                                        a natural inclination to analyze and observe.
                                                    </p>
