                                                        ongoing exploration of ideas, understanding, and the intricate
                                                        workings of the mind.
                                                    </p>
                                                    <p class="description">
                                                        Enneagram Type 5, the Investigator, exhibits distinctive
                                                        strengths and contends with specific challenges:
                                                    </p>


