                                                                Independent Thinking: Investigators are naturally
                                                                independent thinkers, valuing autonomy and relying on
                                                                their own insights to navigate the world.
                                                            </li>
                                                            <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">
                                                                Problem-Solving Skills: Fives excel in problem-solving,
