                                                        <div>
                                                            <!-- static part -->
                                                            <div>
                                                                <h2 class="main_heading" style="margin-top: 400px;">The
                                                                    9 Types of the Enneagram
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <p class="description">
                                                                    The Enneagram is like a diverse cast of characters
                                                                    in the grand play of life. Each type
                                                                    brings
                                                                    its own strengths, quirks, and challenges to the
                                                                    stage, creating a rich tapestry of human
                                                                    experience.
                                                                    It's a tool that helps us understand ourselves and
                                                                    others, fostering empathy and growth.
                                                                    Whether
                                                                    you're a thoughtful Investigator, a spontaneous
                                                                    Enthusiast, or any type in between, the
                                                                    Enneagram invites you to explore the intricate dance
                                                                    of personality and discover the unique
                                                                    role
                                                                    you play
                                                                    in the grand narrative of existence.
                                                                </p>
                                                                <p class="description">
                                                                    The nine types of the Enneagram are commonly divided
