                                                                deeper motivations that drive individuals. The system
                                                                also considers how each type behaves under stress and in
                                                                a state of growth. The Enneagram is often used for
                                                                personal and spiritual development, as well as in
                                                                various professional fields, including psychology,
                                                                business, and leadership training. It provides a nuanced
                                                                understanding of individuals and their interpersonal
                                                                dynamics, offering insights into both strengths and
                                                                challenges associated with each personality type.
