                                                                    <div>
                                                                        <h2 class="main_heading"
                                                                            style="margin-top: 400px;">The 9 Types of
                                                                            the
                                                                            Enneagram
                                                                        </h2>
                                                                        <p class="description">
                                                                            The Enneagram is like a diverse cast of
                                                                            characters in the grand play of life. Each
                                                                            type
                                                                            brings
                                                                            its own strengths, quirks, and challenges to
                                                                            the stage, creating a rich tapestry of human
                                                                            experience.
                                                                            It's a tool that helps us understand
                                                                            ourselves and others, fostering empathy and
