                                                                        with its own set of motivations, fears, and
                                                                        behavioral patterns. It goes beyond merely
                                                                        categorizing behaviors and delves into the
                                                                        deeper motivations that drive individuals. The
                                                                        system also considers how each type behaves
                                                                        under stress and in a state of growth. The
                                                                        Enneagram is often used for personal and
                                                                        spiritual development, as well as in various
                                                                        professional fields, including psychology,
                                                                        business, and leadership training. It provides a
                                                                        nuanced understanding of individuals and their
                                                                        interpersonal dynamics, offering insights into
                                                                        both strengths and challenges associated with
                                                                        each personality type.
                                                                    </p>
                                                                    <p class="description">
                                                                        Your primary type is SEVEN. In following section
