                                                                                to different situations, making them
                                                                                resilient and capable of navigating
                                                                                change.
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ol>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div>
                                                                        <h5 style="margin: 6px 0px;">Challenges</h5>
