                                                                                discomfort can lead Sevens to avoid
                                                                                facing difficult emotions or challenging
                                                                                situations, potentially hindering
                                                                                personal growth.
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">
                                                                                Difficulty with Commitment: Enthusiasts
                                                                                may struggle with committing to
                                                                                long-term projects or relationships,
                                                                                preferring to keep their options open
                                                                                and explore new possibilities.
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">
