                                                                        Enthusiast, are often shaped by a combination of
                                                                        experiences and coping mechanisms. Growing up,
                                                                        Sevens may have been influenced by environments
                                                                        that minimized pain, discomfort, or limitations,
                                                                        fostering a tendency to seek pleasure and
                                                                        novelty as a way of escaping potential
                                                                        negativity. Positive reinforcement for their
